Critique this rotation for damage output and find the highest-impact improvements.

Lead with the trace summary in the diagnostics. Look for concrete, fixable problems: wasted GCDs and downtime, resource capping or starvation, cooldowns drifting or held too long, conditions that never fire or always fire, and high-value actions sitting below weaker ones in the priority. If no trace is present, say so and critique from the rotation structure alone.

